                    "widgetType": "html",
                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"pv-wrap\"><p class=\"kicker\">Fan zone</p><h1>Your idea belongs in the margins.</h1><p class=\"hero-copy\">Choose a prompt, imagine an original character and learn how the concept would be tested for clarity and responsible use.</p></div></section><section class=\"page-section\"><div class=\"pv-wrap two-col\"><div><h2>Creation prompts</h2><div class=\"panel-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr\"><article class=\"comic-panel\"><h3>Power + cost</h3><p>What can the character do, and what meaningful limitation prevents easy solutions?</p></article><article class=\"comic-panel\"><h3>Place + purpose</h3><p>Which community shaped them, and what are they trying to protect?</p></article></div></div><form class=\"pv-form\" data-static-form><label>Character codename<input name=\"codename\" required></label><label>Alignment<select name=\"alignment\"><option>Guardian</option><option>Rival</option><option>Unresolved</option></select></label><label>Power and limitation<textarea name=\"concept\" rows=\"6\" required></textarea></label><button class=\"pv-btn\" type=\"submit\">Check concept</button><p class=\"pv-status\" role=\"status\"></p></form></div></section>"
                    },
